Z||000000||The Dealer||06-21-2001||01:24 PM||||Hey everyone,<P>I was looking at the Fiero today and found that I am going to need to do some interior work.  The driver's seat is pretty well worn, the shifter console has one side broken and it needs to be cleaner pretty bad.  I found a place online for the console, but all I have found about seats is upholstery kits.  I haven't found any place that I could puchase a new seat.  Any suggestions?  Junkyards maybe?<P>The Dealer||||reg||1
